      "writtenOn": "2022-07-15T22:55:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the right timing to release backing_fd inside userspace then? Just after answering to fuse driver? Wouldn\u0027t we have a race between closing fd in the userspace side and fget call inside driver code?",
      "parentUuid": "098c9707_04041d95",
      "revId": "ba4453b2e5d591f54f468572e6dde9df34ab3f8a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
