      "writtenOn": "2022-07-16T00:38:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fget happens within the device communication. Once the write has returned, it has a reference on the handle. At that point it doesn\u0027t matter when the file is closed. We should double check that we handle giving closed or invalid file handles correctly.",
